     "widget": {
      "name": "header",
      "multilineTextboxSpec": {
       "lines": [
        "## Gummi live accuracy\n",
        "Every graded prediction from the gummi_stream pipeline, next to two baselines: **CGM-only** (the published linear method on the last 24 readings) and **last value**. Lower error is better. Replayed BIG IDEAs participants are predicted by a fold model that never saw them, so their numbers are **out-of-sample**. Errors in mg/dL. Draft numbers until the team approves them. Not for treatment decisions."
       ]
      }
